ut spending 1100.00 for that you can get the 3.1 here and maybe spedn another 200-300 in extra parts! and the 1100.00 I was told makes the 2.5 maybe semi a match for the 2.8 so I have changed my thoughts on my Duke as sad as it makes me but oh well its a good motor for the 84 fiero driver that just enjoys driving the car and dont like to race with a Volvo and get whooped! yes my friend has a 84 240 turbo intercooled and can stomp my car dead on the highway and only has 160 hp but it is a Turbo and hasd 160 as to our 90-121? And I have heard that our cars have anywhere from 90-121 for 88 tech 4's? I do notice a slight more power over my 84 and 87 but not too much! so what is righ on my hp?<BR>Thanks guys||||reg||10
